Viktor 13.10.2026, his screenshots 00:07 and 00:09: «исчезла лирика из оверлея в плеере. Но нет... нужно время для распознания. Нужно дописать ПОДОЖДИ! ИДЁТ ПРИВЯЗКА ЛИРИКИ К ВОЛНЕ...». While the take in the player is being timed (sectionsAsked running), the wave draws the notice in its top right corner and the card of a score's mark says the words are on their way; both go when the binding ends or fails. Added only; eleven catalogs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
